# 📋 Rules & Best Practices Summary

Ringkasan cepat rules dan best practices untuk project BMT Lucky Draw System.

## 🚀 Quick Commands

### Code Formatting

```bash
# Format PHP code
composer format

# Check PHP formatting (without fixing)
composer format:test

# Format JavaScript
npm run format

# Check JavaScript formatting
npm run format:check

# Lint JavaScript
npm run lint

# Fix JavaScript linting issues
npm run lint:fix
```

### Code Analysis

```bash
# Run PHPStan static analysis
composer analyse

# Run all checks (format + analyse + test)
composer check
```

### Testing

```bash
# Run tests
composer test
# atau
php artisan test
```

## 📁 File Structure Rules

```
app/
├── Http/
│   └── Controllers/     # Controllers (PascalCase)
├── Livewire/            # Livewire components (PascalCase)
├── Models/              # Eloquent models (PascalCase)
└── Imports/             # Excel imports (PascalCase)

resources/
├── views/
│   ├── admin/           # Admin views
│   ├── auth/            # Auth views
│   ├── components/      # Blade components
│   ├── layouts/         # Layout files
│   └── livewire/        # Livewire views

database/
├── migrations/          # Migration files (snake_case)
└── seeders/             # Database seeders (PascalCase)
```

## 🎯 Naming Conventions

| Type | Convention | Example |
|------|-----------|---------|
| Classes | PascalCase | `PesertaController` |
| Methods | camelCase | `importPeserta()` |
| Variables | camelCase | `$totalPeserta` |
| Constants | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | `MAX_FILE_SIZE` |
| Database Tables | snake_case, plural | `pesertas`, `users` |
| Database Columns | snake_case | `no_rekening`, `status_menang` |
| Routes | kebab-case | `admin.dashboard` |
| Files | PascalCase (PHP) | `PesertaController.php` |

## ✅ Pre-Commit Checklist

Sebelum commit, pastikan:

- [ ] Code sudah di-format: `composer format`
- [ ] Tidak ada linting errors: `npm run lint`
- [ ] Tests passing: `composer test`
- [ ] Tidak ada sensitive data (`.env`, credentials)
- [ ] Migration files sudah dibuat jika ada perubahan DB
- [ ] Documentation updated jika ada perubahan

## 🔒 Security Rules

1. **Always validate input**
   ```php
   $request->validate(['email' => 'required|email']);
   ```

2. **Never use raw queries with user input**
   ```php
   // ❌ BAD
   DB::select("SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = $id");
   
   // ✅ GOOD
   User::find($id);
   ```

3. **Always escape output in Blade**
   ```blade
   {{-- ✅ GOOD --}}
   {{ $userInput }}
   
   {{-- ❌ BAD (kecuali benar-benar perlu) --}}
   {!! $userInput !!}
   ```

4. **Use CSRF protection**
   ```blade
   <form method="POST">
       @csrf
   </form>
   ```

5. **Protect sensitive routes**
   ```php
   Route::middleware('auth')->group(function () {
       // protected routes
   });
   ```

## 📝 Commit Message Format

Gunakan [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/):

```
feat: add Excel import functionality
fix: resolve race condition in winner selection
docs: update installation guide
refactor: simplify PesertaController
test: add unit tests for Undian component
chore: update dependencies
```

## 🎨 Code Style Highlights

### PHP

- 4 spaces indentation
- Single quotes untuk strings
- PSR-12 coding standard
- Type hints untuk methods
- Docblocks untuk public methods

### JavaScript

- 2 spaces indentation
- Single quotes untuk strings
- Semicolons required
- Prefer const/let over var
- Arrow functions untuk callbacks

### Blade

- 4 spaces indentation
- Gunakan components untuk reusability
- Escape output dengan `{{ }}`
- Gunakan `@if`, `@foreach`, dll (bukan PHP tags)

